# The repo is LF throughout, so normalise every text file on commit and check it
# out LF. #2426: one .cs file arrived CRLF via an editor conversion and turned a
# 56-line change into a 2,372-line diff, which is also a merge conflict for every
# concurrent PR touching that file. Pinning *.cs only left every other type agents
# edit exposed, and on 2026-09-07 the same shape recurred on docs/limitations.md
# (#3455): 25 added lines landed as 1560 insertions / 1531 deletions.
#
# text=auto still auto-detects binary content, so the -text lines below are belt
# and braces for types that are unambiguously binary. A .cmd/.bat would need
# `eol=crlf`; none is tracked today.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.app   -text
*.dll   -text
*.exe   -text
*.pdb   -text
*.nupkg -text
*.zip   -text
*.png   -text
*.jpg   -text
*.gif   -text
*.ico   -text
*.snk   -text
*.bak   -text
